<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.34 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.34 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.34 percent on Tuesday from 4.86 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded on the market in three reported transactions with a total value of 2.4 million dinars ($3.4 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
